OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMost areas
OL,6,Fwill have a dry night with clear
OL,7,Fspells, though a few showers are
OL,8,Fpossible in the west, and later near
OL,9,Fto the English Channel coast. Fog
OL,10,Fpatches developing, especially across
OL,11,Fcentral and eastern areas. A mostly
OL,12,Ffrost-free night.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FThursday will be mainly dry
OL,15,Fwith some sunny spells, after the
OL,16,Fclearance of any morning low cloud and
OL,17,Fpatches of fog. A mild day, though
OL,18,Frather breezy in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
